# Server-only (never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_). Event start time that opens the gate.
# Format: ISO 8601 with an explicit UTC offset.
# Missing or invalid = gate stays open (no countdown) and a server error is logged.
# Production: set via wrangler vars (wrangler.jsonc), not a committed .env file.
EVENT_START_AT=2026-12-01T09:00:00+07:00
